.TH FLAKER 1 "September 2026" "flaker 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
flaker \- Interactive TUI manager for NixOS Flakes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B flaker
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBflaker\fR is a fast, keyboard-driven terminal user interface for managing NixOS configurations with Flakes and Git. It provides instant rebuilds, updates, generation inspection, garbage collection, and Git rollback workflows.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help information.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in \fI~/.config/flaker/config.toml\fR.
